    {
      "id": "1000000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 430,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Task: Backend-owned planner turns\nState: Verify\nOwner: Hermes/Codex\nDepends: Workflow Kernel, Agent Bridge, Persistence\nEvidence: merged PR #113 / 870b026 and follow-up PR #115 / 26b24ab; both named exact-head CI jobs succeeded\nLevel: Implemented code and CI evidence; real runtime remains Experimental, not Supported\nRisk: local credentials, CLI behavior, and Electron native ABI remain required"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Task: Productize failure repair regression\nState: Verify\nOwner: Hermes/Codex\nDepends: seeded failed-node evidence and checkpoints; same-session mutation lock projection materialization\nEvidence: merged PR #116 / db49a9f with both exact-head CI jobs successful; follow-up fixes 5a7ff29 and 7659475 are on main\nLevel: Implemented foundations; seeded path remains Experimental, not Supported\nRisk: ordinary New Session default loop remains unproductized; local Codex and Electron ABI dependencies; failed evidence must remain visible"
    },
    {
      "id": "1000000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1210,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Task: Harden explicit delivery gates\nState: Done\nDepends: git evidence, PR exact-head checks\nEvidence: Explicit delivery gates implementation and recovery\nLevel: Implemented and heavily hardened across separate delivery actions\nGate: user confirmed this implemented capability is not product backlog\nBoundary: real GitHub acceptance was not rerun in this documentation-only lane\nRisk: remote side effects still require explicit user gates"
    },
    {
