      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 980,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Backend-owned planner turns\ncommit: 870b026ab0dc0f949e5e3a932575ca6f5327f301 (PR #113) and 26b24abb77c69d1456330f7a480e5618d96cab35 (PR #115)\nbuild: both PRs have exact-head Build and test SUCCESS and Windows AgentBridge (exact head) SUCCESS\nmain: edd660be7015c972b8b645b6d25e949c1c24210b contains both commits\nBoundary: merged PR/CI evidence only; real-agent acceptance was not rerun here; Experimental, not Supported"
