      "y": 1640,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Changes path filter desktop acceptance\ncommit: PR #213 candidate\ntest: Full local gate: 3457 passed, 13 skipped. Production Electron: 7/7 checks, real Git reconciliation, zero Agent launches or delivery actions, zero owned-process leftovers.\nbuild: build/lint/typecheck passed\nmanual: Four screenshots inspected. Synthetic terminal fixture; not live-agent evidence.\nartifact: https://github.com/PeterFile/SkyTurn/pull/213 ; /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261018/changes-filter-ui-result-1792340526361.json"
    },
    {
