      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Risk: Changes filter delivery boundary\nImpact: PR is not integrated into main. Preview counts cover parsed blocks, not complete binary or bounded contents.\nMitigation: Require exact-head CI on PR #213. Filtering never changes the entire delivery changeset; merge requires separate authorization.\nStatus: Documented limitation"
