      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Risk: Real Agent acceptance is blocked by the scratch state-root overlap\nImpact: demo:mvp build and native rebuild passed, then Hermes launch failed: POSIX managed process owner is unavailable. The prescribed scratch fixture is inside HERMES_HOME; pathsOverlap rejects it before CLI execution. Local tests and synthetic Electron fixtures do not prove real Agent completion.\nMitigation: Keep the sandbox boundary. Resume live acceptance only after an explicitly authorized isolated Hermes validation environment is established; no main-profile or credential changes are authorized.\nStatus: Open"
