      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Output find final local and Electron UI evidence\ncommit: none\ntest: Final candidate: pnpm run test --concurrency=1 exit 0; 3488 passed and 13 platform skips in logs, 22 Turbo tasks successful (19 cached). UI package 756 tests passed. productUiFixtureAcceptance.mjs exit 0 proves literal/case-sensitive search, keyboard wrap, no-match, Escape, exact CRLF DOM text and native clipboard in real Electron with explicitly synthetic SQLite output.\nbuild: pnpm run build, lint and typecheck passed. UI candidate SHA256 5ecccb467544deeeb6cc11024d8d5aeead9d73baa4c0de74633f574c08ee4c58 unchanged through acceptance. Native Node ABI restored; persistence 420/420 passed.\nmanual: Screenshots inspected: three content tabs retained, query/count/highlight readable. No real Agent execution claimed; no commit/push/PR/merge.\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/productUiFixtureAcceptance-result-1792248580852.json"
