      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Task reuse Electron draft and restart evidence\ncommit: none\ntest: Final full tests exit 0. Real Electron synthetic fixture passed radio-selection-without-change, Use/Cancel/Replace, exact editable goal, retained target/branch, unchanged source graph/evidence, zero Agent runs and pending-draft persistence after process restart. Fresh Create/session/planner/run identity has deterministic tests only; real Create/Agent gate remains blocked.\nbuild: Final build/lint/typecheck passed. UI candidate SHA256 5ecccb467544deeeb6cc11024d8d5aeead9d73baa4c0de74633f574c08ee4c58. Electron ABI rebuilt for acceptance; Node ABI restored with persistence 420/420 passed.\nmanual: Confirmation and restart screenshots inspected. Attention candidate is absent. No Create clicked; no real Agent execution, commit/push/PR/merge claimed.\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/productUiFixtureAcceptance-result-1792248580852.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "d05696fefa8fd02e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 1860,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Attention navigation lifetime and integrated desktop UI evidence\ncommit: none\ntest: Current UI candidate d2a76bd9099a3cdd548b9cd0e225ed55aa78d6c30f7e3c7aa8c572fbf2bd73d3: build/lint/typecheck passed; 3537 tests passed, 13 skipped; 20/22 Turbo tasks cached. Passive root/project invalidation query-zero regressions passed. Real Electron synthetic fixture passed badge exact-node navigation, no modal, no Agent starts, unchanged workflow events and badge clearing. Does not prove real Agent execution.\nbuild: none\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/productUiAttentionFixtureAcceptance-result-1792256428040.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "355e74eb42461f8e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Task: Hermes read-only startup compatibility\nState: Verify\nOwner: Codex\nDepends: none\nEvidence: Isolated developer runtime passes unchanged sandbox and real model smoke\nRisk: Full MVP commit-lane host trust was not authorized"
    },
    {
      "id": "3d5de3db6d8e0d9f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Isolated runtime crossed overlap gate but fails install-state write\ncommit: none\ntest: demo:mvp exit 1 in isolated sibling state/fixture roots. Hermes process produced failed terminal RunEvidence, exitCode 1, install state is not writable by this user. No model success, workflow intent or Codex lane. User reported isolated OAuth complete; auth validity not yet proven. Main profile and sandbox unchanged.\nbuild: none\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/continuation-real-mvp.log"
    },
    {
      "id": "56216e4dcd90b1bd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 1860,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Risk: Hermes managed dependency startup needs writes outside read-only allowlist\nImpact: Real MVP and reused-task Create success gates remain unverified despite all three synthetic desktop UI checks passing.\nMitigation: Authorized isolated compatibility slice; prefer independent supported runtime. Do not modify main profile, authorize project writes, or enable danger-full-access.\nStatus: Open"
    },
    {
      "id": "ae8ca7cec490300e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Isolated developer runtime passes unchanged sandbox and real model smoke\ncommit: none\ntest: Host parent-validate.sh exit 0: true bootstrap/help, denied project/install/tool/source/venv/dummy-config/dummy-auth writes and fork, allowed prepared state write, all native children reaped. readonlyAgentSmoke.mjs exit 0: authoritative reopened PrivateRunEventStore reports succeeded/exitCode 0, Hermes CLI exit passed, one exact output marker, evidence before one terminal status, cleanup complete. Production sandbox helpers unchanged. Main managed CLI is not claimed fixed.\nbuild: none\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/skyturn-readonly-smoke-apxWRr/receipt.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "3890db11e61254fc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 2080,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Risk: Full MVP commit-lane host trust was not authorized\nImpact: Unmodified demo:mvp requires Codex danger-full-access for its commit lane; full MVP acceptance remains unpassed even if real read-only model and desktop feature checks succeed.\nMitigation: User explicitly declined this mode. Do not rerun it, relax sandbox policy or report a reduced suite as full MVP. Complete remaining real UI checks under existing permissions.\nStatus: Open"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea7da8237d58216d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Real Hermes-backed attention navigation and decision resolution\ncommit: none\ntest: Corrected productUiAcceptance.mjs: two real Hermes turns passed authoritative private terminal and reconciled-intent checks; attentionNavigation, decisionModal and decisionResolution all ok=true. Exact-session/node navigation opens neither modal nor terminal, starts no run and does not answer/resume; More has exactly Output/Changes/Context, Continue clears the inactive badge. Full script exited 1 later at RAW_DIFFERS_FROM_AUTHORITATIVE_OUTPUT; not a complete UI-suite claim.\nbuild: none\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/productUiAcceptance-result-1792260858124-e9789b69.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "1215779b304f352b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Risk: Renderer replay omits captured progress text\nImpact: Real UI Raw text has 533 chars versus authoritative 975 chars; a no-Agent reopen reproduces the mismatch. Earlier synthetic find/copy evidence does not establish production stream parity.\nMitigation: Narrow renderer display/protocol-text split with regression tests; keep model intent parsing stdout-only, preserve exact typed text, and rerun the unchanged real harness. No sandbox or Hermes profile changes.\nStatus: Open"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6481e940c8c8a0a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 2520,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Risk: Real reuse Create is blocked by the preceding output-parity gate\nImpact: Real Hermes startup and attention passed, but the suite stopped before recent reuse/restart/Create. Synthetic draft evidence and unit identities remain valid but do not prove the real reused-goal run.\nMitigation: Repair captured-output reconciliation, keep the failing gate, then run the existing real UI sequence. Full demo:mvp remains excluded because danger-full-access was declined.\nStatus: Open"
    },
    {
      "id": "efaf12ad6a3d647d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Three product increments pass real desktop and Hermes acceptance\ncommit: none\ntest: Unchanged productUiAcceptance.mjs exit 0 with all 13 required checks true on frozen candidate: 3 distinct real Hermes runs independently reread from SQLite as succeeded/exit 0 with CLI checks; attention only navigates, More tabs and answer clearing pass; exact raw/find/native-copy pass; same-project editable reuse, explicit overwrite, branch controls, restart without relaunch, fresh Create, source immutability and cleanup pass. Narrow display/protocol split reviewed NON-BLOCK at diff SHA256 00fa09459b94e72bba7e3183f150f8a6f2ec4678d02b937ce9215686a55f8200. Full tests 3543 passed/13 skipped, 22 Turbo tasks/20 cached. Node ABI restored; persistence 420/420. Decision-only UI acceptance, not full Hermes-to-Codex demo:mvp or native Hermes resume acceptance.\nbuild: pnpm run build, pnpm run lint, pnpm run typecheck and git diff --check passed; source manifest unchanged throughout real run.\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/productUiAcceptance-result-1792261875754-ae1d8e2e.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "0dc66cad054a1433",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1320,
      "y": 1700,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Task: Redact newly announced native Hermes session identifiers\nState: Done\nOwner: Codex\nDepends: none\nEvidence: Hermes public-output privacy and all three product increments pass real acceptance\nRisk: Future documented announcement exposure resolved. Historical output and broader native resume behavior remain outside this slice.\nGate: Local scoped gate: productUiPrivacyAcceptance.mjs 14/14 plus full checks and exact-candidate NON-BLOCK review. 3 real CLI runs and 2 restored Raw views verified. PTY wiring/terminal paths tested synthetically. Future documented plain-text session_id announcements only; no historical rewrite, native resume proof, full demo:mvp or remote delivery."
