      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2520,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Public native session identifier finding without identifier values\ncommit: none\ntest: Read-only SQLite query matched native session_id announcements in 3 authoritative typed progress deltas; final Raw screenshot also shows the announcement. Report contains only application workflow session identity, event sequence, kind and boolean marker, not the native identifier value. No resume attempted.\nbuild: none\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/native-session-identifier-finding.json"
