      "y": 2520,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Scoped Hermes announcement redaction candidate passes static and full checks\ncommit: none\ntest: Synthetic baseline regression reproduced in internal and CLI tests; author 36 redactor and49 entry/PTY focused tests passed. Parent full test3567 passed/13 skipped,22 Turbo tasks/20 cached; independent exact-candidate review NON-BLOCK. Covers fresh no-handle announcements, splits/stream order/EOF and terminal routes, known-handle overlap, private replay/task output/mirror and non-Hermes compatibility. Actual real-model privacy gate remains pending; synthetic pipe/Fake PTY is not real model evidence.\nbuild: Root build/lint/typecheck and diff check passed. Five-path binary diff SHA256115dd8c2da08af9a349305c1bf4ef2f4f95a10f75edffecfc7f4740a0999c792 frozen. No sandbox/persistence/UI changes in this slice.\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/native-id-review-final.txt"
    },
    {
