      "y": 2740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Evidence: Real native announcement redaction observed; extended UI suite remains incomplete\ncommit: none\ntest: First extended privacy suite exit1 UI_TARGET_NOT_UNIQUE at create-once-from-reused-goal because new privacy helper selects reused/source equal titles. Independent read-only SQLite check: 3 distinct real Hermes segments succeeded/exit0/CLI passed; each has one sanitized session_id announcement and zero native identifier shapes. Attention, find/native-copy, reuse draft and restart passed before the selector failure. Do not mark the 14-check suite complete; C/restored Raw and final assertions remain pending.\nbuild: Source and harness unchanged during failed run; production five-path review fingerprint remains frozen. Node ABI restored and persistence420/420 after this run.\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/native-id-first-real-partial-verification.json"
    },
    {
