      "text": "Evidence: Hermes public-output privacy and all three product increments pass real acceptance\ncommit: none\ntest: productUiPrivacyAcceptance.mjs exit0:14/14 required checks, retaining all13 functional gates and adding privacy.3 distinct real non-PTY Hermes runs succeeded/exit0/CLI passed;3 live and2 restarted sessions have positive redacted announcements across authoritative typed output/canonical output/Raw. Error/evidence metadata checked; independent SQLite readback each run has1 redacted announcement and0 native identifier shapes. Exact native clipboard, fresh reuse identity/source preservation and cleanup pass. Screenshot file hashes verified; no fixture processes remain. PTY coverage remains synthetic tests, not a real interactive-model claim.\nbuild: Frozen source/harness unchanged. Independent review NON-BLOCK. Root build/lint/typecheck/test passed:3567 passed/13 skipped;22 Turbo tasks/20 cached. Harness88/88 deterministic checks. Final Node ABI restored; persistence420/420. Earlier failed suite remains preserved; only identity-based harness selection changed for rerun.\nmanual: none\nartifact: /Users/cwp/.hermes/cache/scratch/skyturn-wave-20261017/native-id-final-parent-verification.json"
